/*
  ProgressRing.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0099 · ProgressRing (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The web source
  (components/data-display/ProgressRing.tsx) renders NO translatable copy of its own: every visible
  string — the caption (`label`), the centered primary text (`centerLabel`), and the centered secondary
  text (`centerSubLabel`) — is caller-supplied data, exactly as in the web props, not this component's
  copy. There are therefore no message keys to mirror, and the Swift sources hold no English literals.

  The surface's only locale-sensitive output is the accessibility percentage reading, which is composed
  from the numeric fill (ProgressRingAccessibility.percentText) rather than from a translatable string.
  The per-surface table name ("ProgressRing") is reserved here so the file-set stays consistent with its
  sibling surfaces and folds into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time
  should localizable chrome ever be added.
*/
